  "body": "**P0: main does not compile.** `crates/app/src/warned_moves.rs:23` fails with E0004: `Warning::HolderHit` is not covered.\n\n**Cause:** two merges from today that each passed on their own. PR #454 (#349) added `warned_moves::moves_named`, which matches every `verify::Warning`. PR #395 (#369) then added `Warning::HolderHit { at, part, short_mm }`.\n\n**Fix:** `HolderHit` names one move (`at`), like `FixtureHit`, so it joins the single-move arm. One line.\n\n**Pinned by:** `warned_moves::tests::every_located_kind_names_its_move_and_the_unjudged_note_names_none`, which now also asserts that a `HolderHit` names its move.\n\n**Gate (own worktree and target):**\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --lib warned_moves`: 3 passed.\n- `--test warned_moves`: 2 passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -D warnings`: clean. That also proves the UI crate compiles again.\n\n**Not exercised:** the rest of the suites. Main needs at least a batch run after this lands, since ~25 PRs merged today without a combined test run.\n\nChangelog: none (build fix for an unreleased combination)\n\nFixes #460\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
